\n\nSince $-{66.801}^{∘}$ lies outside the given domain, it is not a solution.\n\nTo generate more solutions, we add integer multiples of ${180}^{∘}.$ Hence,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1} & ={180}^{∘}+x \\\\  & ={180}^{∘}+(-{66.801}^{∘}) \\\\  & =113.199 \\\\  & ≈{113}^{∘}, \\\\ {x}_{2} & =2\\cdot {180}^{∘}+x \\\\  & ={360}^{∘}+(-{66.801}^{∘}) \\\\  & =293.199 \\\\  & ≈{293}^{∘},\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\neach rounded to the nearest integer.\n\nTherefore, in ascending order, the solutions are $x={113}^{∘}$ and $x={293}^{∘}.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13978897/state.json" "file_sha256" "2c754dc690a836b9ca4b87b9b05ffe34a8684e62be8a66d213448616d0770ad7"} {"question" "q-274562" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13978897/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "6612beaf8e0032d1dc5cd7c9320856b8cdd9c8c6f14b2e8b6858738690f64225"} {"question" "q-274562" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13978897/state.json" "file_sha256" "2c754dc690a836b9ca4b87b9b05ffe34a8684e62be8a66d213448616d0770ad7"} {"question" "q-274562" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "113"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13978897/state.json" "file_sha256" "2c754dc690a836b9ca4b87b9b05ffe34a8684e62be8a66d213448616d0770ad7"} {"question" "q-274562" "field" "field-2" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13978897/state.json" "file_sha256" "2c754dc690a836b9ca4b87b9b05ffe34a8684e62